{
	chapter.0477CFD30EC86DEA.title: " &c&lMobstein Creations "
	chapter.080035B5EA4139BB.title: " &c&lWelcome to Horrorland 2 "
	chapter.0EA18B8D0107CF96.title: " &c&lBosses of Mass Destruction"
	chapter.14A3D9A1DC6717F5.title: " &c&lZombie Nightmare "
	chapter.1A07A3D99382CBCA.title: " &c&lArthropod Phobia"
	chapter.3B1D0E46719C5BD9.title: " &c&lGrim and Bleak "
	chapter.422E7D4B90197BB5.title: " &c&lThe Undead Revamped"
	chapter.50D8274C19F6E1EB.title: " &c&lDeeper and Darker"
	chapter.607FC2F333440F95.title: " &c&lCorail Tombstone "
	chapter.6D0ECE7E01501FB3.title: " &c&lEvil Craft"
	chapter.72F0ACECF7719B4D.title: " &c&lBorn in Chaos "
	file.0000000000000001.title: " &r&4&lHorrorland 2"
	quest.009E4A6BB7EF1776.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Pregnant is a large, very tanky zombie whose arms drag along the ground and is never seen alone. This mob is highly disruptive and deals a respectable amount of damage."
		""
		"Companions: She always spawns with 4 zombies and can control other monsters' minds (like spiders and skeletons) to fight for her."
		""
		"Attack: She will puke a large amount of fluid (inflicting poison damage), and will launch players far with extreme knockback."
		""
		"Bidy Spawns: If you get too far away, she will spawn small, explosive zombies called Bidies."
		""
		"Death: Upon death, she will slam her body on the ground, dealing Area-of-Effect (AoE) damage."
		""
		"You can temporarily disable her puking attacks by hitting her right after she pukes. Defeat this formidable foe who has 100 health (in some versions) and 3 armor!"
	]
	quest.009E4A6BB7EF1776.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat The Pregnant&r, the large, disruptive zombie boss."
	quest.009E4A6BB7EF1776.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lSlaying The Pregnant"
	quest.010FC3945A271F96.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.010FC3945A271F96.quest_subtitle: "&c&lA mysterious artifact used to summon the wendigo"
	quest.010FC3945A271F96.title: "&l&4Craft The Cursed Artifact"
	quest.0130F5E9327C8364.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour mastery of EvilCraft begins with the critical resource of Blood, and the Blood Extractor is the first step into forbidden power. To initiate the \"second age of evilness,\" you must create this essential device."
		""
		"The Blood Extractor is used to gather the precious Blood resource, which is the foundation for numerous rituals, materials, and advanced structures in the mod. Forge this tool and begin experimenting with the dark art of blood magic! 🔮"
	]
	quest.0130F5E9327C8364.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Blood Extractor&r to begin harnessing Blood Magic."
	quest.0130F5E9327C8364.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Initiating the Second Evil Age 🩸⚙️"
	quest.018E19B1AC680491.quest_desc: ["&rThe Crab Constrictor is an enormous, devastating miniboss that lurks beneath the ocean, representing a major element of thalassophobia. It has 300 HP and is very powerful, bridging the gap between minibosses and bosses."]
	quest.018E19B1AC680491.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Crab Constrictor miniboss&r and obtain its Crusher Claw."
	quest.018E19B1AC680491.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Crab Constrictor 🦀⚓"
	quest.0235FA2B08FC4931.quest_desc: ["&rThe Draconic Voidlasher is a massive, corrupted boss entity that blends draconic and void energies, representing one of the ultimate challenges in the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."]
	quest.0235FA2B08FC4931.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Draconic Voidlasher&r boss and survive its corrupted void power."
	quest.0235FA2B08FC4931.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Draconic Voidlasher 🐉💥"
	quest.060F87D5F47EFF93.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Ancient City is vast, but hidden within its sprawl is the most dangerous and protected part of the complex: the Sculk Temple. This structure is a nexus of power and likely guarded by the fiercest Sculk Monsters."
		""
		"You must meticulously search the sprawling ruins, navigating the reinforced deepslate hallways and avoiding the noise-triggered traps. Locate the Temple to prove you have mastered the exploration of the enhanced Deep Dark. The greatest secrets await! 🤫"
	]
	quest.060F87D5F47EFF93.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Explore the depths for a Sculk Temple structure&r."
	quest.060F87D5F47EFF93.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Exploring the Shadowed Temple 🏛🌑"
	quest.075609F39A80750E.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Tormented Zombie is a hideous monstrosity that disguises itself as a regular player, having eight different player skin variants. When stationary, it maintains the normal player skin, but its true nightmarish form emerges as soon as it moves."
		""
		"This strong and vicious opponent can sometimes be found hanging from ceilings or crawling through tight spaces. Defeating this enemy is worthwhile, as it drops golden apples on death!"
	]
	quest.075609F39A80750E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Tormented Zombie&r, the hideous monstrosity in disguise."
	quest.075609F39A80750E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Tormented Zombie"
	quest.07A2763CB160B456.quest_desc: [
		"&rDarksteel is the main ore of Limbo, serving as a powerful material that is slightly better than iron and applies a brief Wither effect to enemies. You must forge a set of this armor to survive the horrors of the dimension:"
		""
		"Light Darksteel Armor: This variant costs Darksteel and Ripped Cloth (obtained from Ghouls). It makes you lighter, increasing your speed and jump height, while reducing fall damage. It comes in red and black variants."
		""
		"Heavy Darksteel Armor: This variant offers more protection (even slightly better than Netherite), but it is more expensive and will slow you down due to the weight."
		""
		"Choose the armor that fits your playstyle and forge this essential protection! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.07A2763CB160B456.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a full set of Darksteel Armor&r, choosing between the Light or Heavy variant."
	quest.07A2763CB160B456.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging Darksteel Armor"
	quest.0DF5B480CFBA5334.quest_desc: [
		"&rGrave Dust is a fundamental and essential crafting ingredient in the Corail Tombstone mod. This material is the base for many of the mod's arcane items and resurrection mechanics."
		""
		"While the exact method is not detailed here, Grave Dust is typically acquired by interacting with your Tombstone or a related structure, often through a magical or ritualistic process. Acquire this dust to unlock the potential for powerful enchantments and gear in the mod! 🔮"
	]
	quest.0DF5B480CFBA5334.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain Grave Dust&r for crafting and rituals."
	quest.0DF5B480CFBA5334.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eAcquiring Grave Dust ⚱✨"
	quest.1054006B18F4756E.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1054006B18F4756E.quest_subtitle: "&c&l :D ?"
	quest.1054006B18F4756E.title: "&l&0Fall into the void"
	quest.1114AFAF1A87DFC7.quest_desc: ["&rWelcome to Horrorland 2 a dimension where nightmares are real and survival is anything but guaranteed. This modpack plunges you into a world built for terror, featuring enhanced mobs, dark magic, and unsettling structures."]
	quest.1114AFAF1A87DFC7.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Horrorland 2 Modpack&r and begin your survival nightmare."
	quest.1114AFAF1A87DFC7.title: "&c&lWelcome to Horrorland 2 "
	quest.121AB1584171EB37.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Grim and Bleak, an ambience-focused semi-horror mod that mixes survival gameplay with terrifying horror mechanics. This mod's core feature is the chilling new dimension: Limbo."
		""
		"Limbo initially appears dark and empty, but you will quickly realize you are not alone. To begin your exploration, you must craft a Compass of Pains and then light a portal constructed out of Chiseled Deepslate. Be warned: your actions in Limbo can have consequences in the Overworld! 🕯️"
	]
	quest.121AB1584171EB37.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Grim and Bleak Mod&r and find the path to Limbo."
	quest.121AB1584171EB37.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lWelcome to Grim &7&l and Bleak "
	quest.1253F6D4F50A1819.quest_desc: [
		"&rLimbo is a completely dark and seemingly empty dimension at first glance, though abominations roam endlessly. To access this partly horror-focused realm, you must follow a two-step process:"
		""
		"Craft a Compass of Pains."
		""
		"Build a portal frame out of Chiseled Deepslate and light the portal."
		""
		"Be prepared to face the Ghouls, common mobs that drop Ripped Cloth (used for light armor) and Cursed Bones (used for a Cursed Sword). Step through the gateway and enter the perpetual shadow! 💀"
	]
	quest.1253F6D4F50A1819.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Compass of Pains and light the Chiseled Deepslate Portal&r to access the Limbo Dimension."
	quest.1253F6D4F50A1819.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lPassage to Limbo "
	quest.129E4BC47C15D6BC.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour mastery of dark energy requires capturing the very essence of retribution. The Vengeance Spirit is a potent entity you need to contain for advanced rituals."
		""
		"To perform this capture, you must first craft the Vengeance Focus. You then use this focus to locate and ensnare the spirit, trapping it within the special container known as the Box of Eternal Closure. Successfully containing this vengeful energy is a major step in your progression! 🔮"
	]
	quest.129E4BC47C15D6BC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Use a Vengeance Focus to capture a Vengeance Spirit in a Box of Eternal Closure&r."
	quest.129E4BC47C15D6BC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Capturing Vengeance 👻📦"
	quest.12AB42DB1A0D2C61.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Skeleton Thrasher is a formidable but slow enemy with increased armor. This foe poses a unique tactical challenge due to its defensive and offensive abilities:"
		"Blocking: It is able to block the player's attacks, similar to the Door Knight. To disarm its defense, you need to set it on fire or make an attack with an axe."
		"Stunning Attack: Its attacks, in addition to high damage, will strongly repel the enemy and briefly stun them, making it impossible to move or attack."
		"Defeat this powerful but sluggish opponent to assert your dominance over the chaos!"
	]
	quest.12AB42DB1A0D2C61.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Skeleton Thrasher&r, the formidable, slow, and stunning foe."
	quest.12AB42DB1A0D2C61.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Skeleton Thrasher "
	quest.16B2324761BE5287.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spine Wrencher is a tall, thin entity with long tendril-like arms, visually related to the Blood Eagle. This enemy is dangerous because it requires close proximity to spot you, but once it does, it will immediately notice and run towards your location."
		""
		"Due to its thin structure, it is surprisingly fragile. This creates a key weakness: if you block its attacks with a shield, the entity will take damage whenever it tries to strike, providing a strong counter method."
		""
		"The Spine Wrencher is more than two blocks tall, but it can crouch down to get through smaller gaps. Upon defeat, it drops \"Distorted Vertebrae,\" which are used for crafting the powerful Whiplasher item."
	]
	quest.16B2324761BE5287.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the tall, thin Spine Wrencher&r entity."
	quest.16B2324761BE5287.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Spine Wrencher"
	quest.18DB8C358DBB4097.quest_desc: ["This is the last Weaver of a forgotten cult. He posseses knowledge on the dead and the ancient technique of soul weaving, transforming souls into something else. Although the cult as fallen long ago, the Weaver still lives on, chained up in an ancient grave for an unknown reason. &l&3Found in 0 1 0 of the deep void."]
	quest.18DB8C358DBB4097.quest_subtitle: "&l&9This is the last Weaver of a forgotten cult. "
	quest.18DB8C358DBB4097.title: "&l&9Kill The Weaver Of Souls"
	quest.18FCDCE10B244961.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Lich Tower is a rare structure that spawns in the Overworld's colder biomes. This tower is the key to confronting the powerful Night Lich boss, who can be summoned there."
		""
		"Before you can summon the boss, you must first obtain Soul Stars from the undead. The tower is home to an assortment of hostile mobs, including Skeletons equipped with enchanted armor. Search carefully, as the tower also contains Chests with loot."
	]
	quest.18FCDCE10B244961.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Find the Lich Tower structure&r in the Overworld's colder biomes."
	quest.18FCDCE10B244961.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cLocating the Lich Tower"
	quest.194344D62D4D7A78.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Tormentor is the final, ultimate boss entity, representing the pinnacle of horror and challenge in the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."
		""
		"This is the most dangerous demonic boss entity you will face, commanding unimaginable power and using unique, terrifying mechanics. You must utilize all the specialized gear and knowledge gained from defeating the other arthropod and demonic foes to survive this final encounter. Successfully slaying the Tormentor signifies your complete mastery over the mod's horrors! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.194344D62D4D7A78.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the final boss, the Tormentor&r, and conquer the ultimate horror."
	quest.194344D62D4D7A78.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Tormentor 👹💥"
	quest.1A4B0B6FD90B1ECC.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Moonflower is a Demonic Undead mob that is really fast and can spot enemies from far away. It spawns anywhere in the Overworld."
		""
		"Key Weaknesses and Strategy:"
		""
		"Perfume is a Must-Have: The key to fighting the Moonflower is the Arapholia perfume. Using this perfume on any mob (except other undead not sprayed) will cause the Moonflower to target that mob instead of you."
		""
		"Arapholia Flower: This flower drops from the Moonflower or spawns naturally on Plains or Taiga biomes."
		""
		"Stun Chance: The Moonflower has a chance of getting stunned if hit airborne."
		""
		"Use the perfume to control its aggression and eliminate this extremely fast threat!"
	]
	quest.1A4B0B6FD90B1ECC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Moonflower&r, the really fast Demonic Undead."
	quest.1A4B0B6FD90B1ECC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lSlaying the Moonflower"
	quest.1AE823FF61EF5E2E.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Exalted Crafter is a specialized crafting table that is vital for executing the more complex and high-tier recipes within EvilCraft. To craft this table, you must already have access to many of the mod's initial resources and base crafting stations."
		""
		"Successfully creating this advanced crafting station is jokingly called Craft-Ception. Forge this Exalted Crafter to unlock a new level of alchemical and magical construction! 🔮"
	]
	quest.1AE823FF61EF5E2E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft an Exalted Crafter&r and achieve Craft-Ception."
	quest.1AE823FF61EF5E2E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8The Exalted Crafter ⚙️✨"
	quest.1D22658C04511FEE.quest_desc: ["{image:under_the_moon:block/peeker_fetus width:50 height:50 align:center}"]
	quest.1D22658C04511FEE.quest_subtitle: "&l&8An exploding monster in creep forests"
	quest.1D22658C04511FEE.title: "&l&0Kill a Peeker"
	quest.1D75D1A343111CDA.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Otherside is a chilling new dimension that enhances the Deep Dark experience. Having pierced the dimensional veil using the Heart of the Deep, your final challenge is to chart every strange and unsettling biome this realm holds."
		""
		"You must venture off the main path and explore every distinct corner of this bizarre new dimension. Complete this grand survey to achieve true mastery over the geography of the Deeper and Darker mod! 🔭🌌"
	]
	quest.1D75D1A343111CDA.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Explore all biomes&r found within the Otherside dimension."
	quest.1D75D1A343111CDA.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Otherside Cartographer 🗺🌟"
	quest.1E07B0C5C9379355.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour journey into the arcane starts with discovering the ancient source of evil that permeates this world."
		""
		"You must delve into the earth and mine at least one Dark Ore. You will need an Iron Pickaxe or higher to successfully mine the ore. The ore drops a Dark Gem, which is the fundamental material needed for nearly all progression in the mod. Obtaining this gem is the first step toward initiating a second age of evilness! ⛏️"
	]
	quest.1E07B0C5C9379355.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Mine a Dark Ore&r to obtain a Dark Gem and begin learning the mod's history."
	quest.1E07B0C5C9379355.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8The Origins of Darkness 💎⛏️"
	quest.1F1FF5484E32D818.quest_desc: ["&rThe Spider Moth is a massive, horrifying boss entity that blends the aspects of a spider and a moth, creating a grotesque flying terror. This is one of the most significant demonic boss entities added by the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."]
	quest.1F1FF5484E32D818.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Spider Moth&r boss and claim the Entropy Matrix."
	quest.1F1FF5484E32D818.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Spider Moth 🕷🦋"
	quest.20950CC7C9E591CA.quest_desc: [
		"&rBringing an enhanced creature back to life demands first constructing its physical form. After obtaining Descomposed Leather (which is made by \"cooking\" leather), your next step is to craft any Full Body component for the Mobstein creature you desire."
		""
		"This stage is vital, as the Full Body acts as the foundation upon which the creature will ultimately be resurrected. Consult the mod's guidebook or crafting list for the necessary recipe, and begin the intricate process of assembling your new companion!"
	]
	quest.20950CC7C9E591CA.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft any Full Body component&r required for the resurrection ritual."
	quest.20950CC7C9E591CA.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Essential Anatomy"
	quest.20E0846ACA9C5F4D.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Restless Spirit is believed to be the soul of fallen Piglin warriors who died in the Withered Forest battlefield. This entity is invisible, only visible with the help of particles."
		"The Spirit is generally weak but incredibly agile, making it difficult to hit."
		"Key Weakness: The Spirit can be easily exorcized by simply holding a Chainmail armor piece in your hand."
		"Upon defeat, the Restless Spirit drops Restless Nature with a 100% chance. If you exorcize it with a Chainmail armor piece, it has a 50% chance to drop an Experience Bottle. "
	]
	quest.20E0846ACA9C5F4D.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Restless Spirit&r and claim its Restless Nature."
	quest.20E0846ACA9C5F4D.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Restless Spirit "
	quest.211F3BBE7BE43F19.quest_desc: [
		"This boss can be found in &7&llich prisons&r far above &l&boceans&r. It can be summoned using three of the &l&8Ominous bone fragments&r and a &4&lbottle of blood vial&l. You can get the blood vial by killing villagers with the &l&7bone dagger&r and an empty bottle on your offhand."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The boss is summoned by placing thee fragments on &l&0corrupted deepslate&r and sacrificing the blood on the &l&3altar at night."
		""
		"{image:graveyard:item/corruption width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.211F3BBE7BE43F19.quest_subtitle: "&4&lThe old champion that was corrupted."
	quest.211F3BBE7BE43F19.title: "&7&lKill The Corrupted Champion"
	quest.21F80E017920E4BD.quest_desc: ["&rTo build a Nether Portal, the frame must be a rectangular shape made of Obsidian blocks. The minimum functional size requires 10 Obsidian blocks (leaving the corners open) or 14 blocks for a complete 4x5 frame. You can collect Obsidian by mining it with a Diamond Pickaxe or by using a water bucket and a lava source to form the shape. Once the frame is complete, you must light the inside of the frame using a Flint and Steel or a Fire Charge by right-clicking the inner air space or bottom block. Once activated, step through the purple glowing area to enter the Nether!"]
	quest.21F80E017920E4BD.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Build and activate a Nether Portal&r to travel to the new dimension."
	quest.21F80E017920E4BD.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&fThe Gateway to the Nether"
	quest.221B50243C6C4CF5.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Scarlet Persecutor is a dangerous mob that is summoned into existence by the Fallen Chaos Knight. These enemies appear around the cursed victim when the Cursed Mark placed by the Knight expires."
		"Your goal is to defeat the Fallen Chaos Knight, but you must first prove you can handle its summoned minions. Slay the Scarlet Persecutor to eliminate the immediate threat caused by the Cursed Mark!"
	]
	quest.221B50243C6C4CF5.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Scarlet Persecutor&r summoned by a Cursed Mark."
	quest.221B50243C6C4CF5.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Scarlet Persecutor"
	quest.22434769CB9ACD7D.quest_desc: [
		"&rCursed Bones are a necessary crafting material, used for forging the Cursed Sword (which applies Weakness) and for creating offering idols for Dark Rituals. This material is dropped by the common hostile mob found wandering the Limbo dimension:"
		""
		"Slay Ghouls: These are common mobs found throughout Limbo."
		""
		"Loot the Drops: Ghouls drop Cursed Bones (along with Ripped Cloth) upon death."
		""
		"Venture into the darkness and hunt the Ghouls to secure this vital arcane component! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.22434769CB9ACD7D.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain Cursed Bones&r by slaying the common Ghouls in Limbo."
	quest.22434769CB9ACD7D.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lAcquiring Cursed Bones"
	quest.229409AC02D2D1FA.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Door Knight is a formidable zombie that uses everything at hand as its equipment. This monster is a persistent enemy, boasting protection from sunlight and increased armor."
		"Key Mechanics and Weaknesses:"
		"Blocking: The Door Knight is able to block your attacks, accompanied by a special sound."
		"Disabling Block: To deprive the mob of its ability to block attacks, you need to set it on fire or make an attack with an axe."
		"Find this armored foe, disable its shield with fire or an axe, and defeat it! "
	]
	quest.229409AC02D2D1FA.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Door Knight&r, the shield-wielding, blocking zombie."
	quest.229409AC02D2D1FA.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Door Knight "
	quest.2327344AD59D5F9B.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Sculk does not just grow; it breeds fear. To cleanse the Ancient City and claim true dominance, you must eliminate every type of enemy that the Sculk summons. This includes the elusive Sculk Snare, the explosive Sculk Terror, the blinding Sculk Lurker, and any other corrupted entity."
		""
		"Face the horrors, learn their tactics, and silence them forever. Only when all types of Sculk Monsters have fallen by your hand will the area truly feel safe. 🌑⚔️"
	]
	quest.2327344AD59D5F9B.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay one of every Sculk Monster&r that lurks in the deep dark."
	quest.2327344AD59D5F9B.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Silence the Sculk Menace 💀🎤"
	quest.27EDFE7859A44D54.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour survival in the dark dimension of Limbo depends on your ability to defeat its inhabitants. The Ghouls are the most common monsters and abominations found roaming endlessly throughout this dark world. They were once humans who lost their mind and soul."
		""
		"While Ghouls are not terribly dangerous, they are a prevalent threat in Limbo. Slaying Ghouls is essential for gathering valuable resources like Ripped Cloth (for light armor) and Cursed Bones (for a Cursed Sword). Face these tortured souls to claim your needed materials! 💥"
	]
	quest.27EDFE7859A44D54.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay a Ghoul&r, the common monster of Limbo."
	quest.27EDFE7859A44D54.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lCulling the Ghouls"
	quest.28E8018314B865D3.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Thunder Gem is a rare and essential material required to craft the ultimate weapon: the Thunder Sword. This sword is the only weapon that can effectively kill the final boss, the Gate Guardian."
		""
		"Since the recipe is complex, you are strongly encouraged to consult a guide like Just Enough Items (JEI) to find the exact crafting process for this crucial gem. Once obtained, you are one step closer to wielding a truly godly power against the boss! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.28E8018314B865D3.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Acquire a Thunder Gem&r, a core component for the Thunder Sword."
	quest.28E8018314B865D3.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Thunder Gem"
	quest.2B3A7FCE6EF4AE0A.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Carbon Blood set is the endgame material set for the mod, including every piece of armor and tool. This tool set is quite powerful, more efficient than Netherite, and less durable than Netherite but more than Diamond."
		""
		"To begin crafting the tools, you must first create the following core materials:"
		""
		"Carbon Ingots: You need 1 Darksteel Plate, 4 Coal, and 4 Withered Apples to make these."
		""
		"Dried Blood: This is obtained by placing blood bottles in a furnace."
		""
		"Blood Infused Steel Ingots: Combine 3 Carbon Ingots and 6 Dried Blood to make 4 of these ingots."
		""
		"Darksteel Handle: This component is also necessary for the tools and is made from Withered Sticks and Darksteel Ingots."
		""
		"Once the tool is crafted, it can be repaired with Blood Bottles in an Anvil and will give a brief Haste effect when right-clicked. Just Enough Items (JEI) is strongly recommended to learn all the complex recipes. ⚔️"
	]
	quest.2B3A7FCE6EF4AE0A.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft all necessary components to forge a tool from the Carbon Blood set&r."
	quest.2B3A7FCE6EF4AE0A.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Carbon Blood Tool Set"
	quest.2CE9CC637ED333DD.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Brutaliser is a formidable mini-boss—a huge, strong zombie that poses a devastating threat on the ground. It hunts sheep."
		""
		"Be extremely cautious in combat, as its primary attack is to smash the ground to create block shockwaves that deal devastating damage and heavy knockback on impact. You can jump over or evade these shockwaves."
		""
		"Upon defeating the Brutaliser, it drops a valuable item called a \"Deathly Onyx\". This onyx is used for crafting the special Staff of the Undying, which allows you to repulse nearby undead mobs and summon crawling minions."
	]
	quest.2CE9CC637ED333DD.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Brutaliser&r mini-boss"
	quest.2CE9CC637ED333DD.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Brutaliser"
	quest.2D75D8CF2BAA2776.quest_desc: [
		"&rYou have claimed the Heart of the Deep from the slain Warden. This artifact is the final key needed to pierce the veil and access the Otherside dimension."
		""
		"To activate the gateway:"
		""
		"Clear the Inner Frame: Ensure the reinforced deepslate portal frame is completely cleared of all Sculk veins and obstructions."
		""
		"Ignite the Portal: Right-click the reinforced deepslate with the Heart of the Deep."
		""
		"The dimensional energies will surge, opening the portal and allowing you to step through into the chilling realm of the Otherside! 🌌"
	]
	quest.2D75D8CF2BAA2776.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Ignite the Otherside Portal and enter the Otherside dimension&r."
	quest.2D75D8CF2BAA2776.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Igniting the &5Otherside Gate&r 🔥🔑"
	quest.3064BACE96C0D99F.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to EvilCraft, a mod that delves into the dark side of magic and creation! This mod introduces a powerful and unique system centered around the manipulation of dark energy and forbidden rituals."
		""
		"Your journey begins by finding the initial resources needed to interact with the mod's arcane systems. Prepare to explore concepts like blood magic, alchemy, and necromancy. Embrace the darkness and begin your mastery of EvilCraft! 🩸"
	]
	quest.3064BACE96C0D99F.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the EvilCraft Mod&r and begin your dark journey."
	quest.3064BACE96C0D99F.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Welcome to Evil &4&lCraft 💀🔮"
	quest.324050764E40F5CF.quest_desc: [
		"&rDarksteel Ore is the main ore you will find and use in Limbo, serving as the dimension's equivalent to iron, but with slightly better properties. This ore is crucial for forging the mod's core equipment, as it imparts a brief Wither effect to enemies when used."
		""
		"You can find Darksteel Ore naturally generating in the caves of the Limbo dimension. Mine this dark metal to begin crafting the powerful light or heavy Darksteel armors and exotic Darksteel weapons! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.324050764E40F5CF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Find Darksteel Ore&r in the caves of the Limbo dimension."
	quest.324050764E40F5CF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lMining Darksteel Ore "
	quest.32BDB1416B7279B4.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Blood Eagle is a huge demon/dragon-like zombie. This extremely strong creature sports razor-sharp teeth and has appendages made entirely from stretched-out flesh."
		""
		"It is capable of both flying and walking, sometimes attacking from the air with spit projectiles or from the ground with melee attacks. It consumes pigs."
		""
		"Be aware that the Blood Eagle is also tameable and rideable (tamed with 10 deathly hearts, though this is configurable). Defeat this flying horror to claim your reward!"
	]
	quest.32BDB1416B7279B4.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Blood Eagle&r, the huge demon/dragon-like zombie."
	quest.32BDB1416B7279B4.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Blood Eagle"
	quest.33238F50DEF7F269.quest_desc: ["&rThe Solifuge Skulker is a huge, lightning-fast arthropod, essentially a giant desert camel spider. This mob is highly dangerous due to its speed and unique attacks."]
	quest.33238F50DEF7F269.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Solifuge Skulker&r, the lightning-fast desert arthropod."
	quest.33238F50DEF7F269.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Solifuge Skulker 🕷🏜"
	quest.3373DED704E46F97.quest_desc: [
		"Void blossom can be found using &l&dvoid lilies&r that point to it. The void blossom &l&aspawns underground."
		""
		"{image:bosses_of_mass_destruction:block/void_lily width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3373DED704E46F97.quest_subtitle: "&5&lThe corrupted flower of the void"
	quest.3373DED704E46F97.title: "&d&lKill The Void Blossom"
	quest.3476AFAEF867E02A.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Sonorous Staff is a specialized tool that channels the dark, resonant energy of the Sculk. It is a coveted item, requiring rare components found only in the deepest parts of the Ancient City."
		""
		"Craft or discover this staff to unlock new utility, control the terrifying power of sound, and assert your dominance over the silent realm! ✨"
	]
	quest.3476AFAEF867E02A.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Acquire a Sonorous Staff&r, a powerful artifact of the deep."
	quest.3476AFAEF867E02A.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Wielding the &5Sonorous Staff&r 🪄🎶"
	quest.35B1A6BB1E0BE45B.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Nether Gauntlet is a powerful boss found in rare structures that generate throughout the Nether dimension. This mob attacks you using its massive fists and magical power."
		""
		"The Gauntlet can only be damaged by attacking its eye. Its attacks include:"
		""
		"A powerful closed fist punch."
		""
		"A continuous laser attack for consistent damage."
		""
		"A heavily damaging charged fist attack, which gives you a brief time to avoid the blow."
		""
		"Upon defeating this challenging boss, you will be rewarded with Ancient Debris."
	]
	quest.35B1A6BB1E0BE45B.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Nether Gauntlet&r boss in its rare Nether structure."
	quest.35B1A6BB1E0BE45B.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cSlaying the Nether Gauntlet"
	quest.38D7D71FC512D71C.quest_desc: ["&rThe Spider Prowler is a highly dangerous enemy that serves as a common threat within the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod. This creature is an expert ambush predator, known for its silence and ability to strike quickly from the shadows."]
	quest.38D7D71FC512D71C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Spider Prowler&r, the ambush predator of the deep."
	quest.38D7D71FC512D71C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Spider Prowler 🕷🥷"
	quest.3900C8DA529A60A6.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Wasp Nemesis is a huge, fearsome miniboss that brings a unique threat to the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."
		""
		"This boss is known for its ability to summon countless wasp minions to swarm and overwhelm you. You must hunt down the Wasp Nemesis to prevent it from establishing massive nests and flooding the Overworld with its aggressive drones."
	]
	quest.3900C8DA529A60A6.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Wasp Nemesis miniboss&r and stop its reign of terror."
	quest.3900C8DA529A60A6.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Wasp Nemesis 🐝💥"
	quest.39F6CF91CB9060FC.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Thornshell Crab is a huge, armored boss entity that is a significant threat in the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod. This massive crab is known for its tough, spiky exterior, making it resistant to many forms of attack."
		"You must find the structure or area where the Thornshell Crab resides and prepare for a challenging battle. You will need to devise a strategy to bypass its powerful shell and eliminate this armored arthropod to claim its unique and valuable drops! "
	]
	quest.39F6CF91CB9060FC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Thornshell Crab boss&r and break its powerful defenses."
	quest.39F6CF91CB9060FC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Thornshell Crab "
	quest.3A2B67E8C2DCF8F9.quest_desc: [
		"Also summonable by placing a soul sand block on top of a &8&lmangled fly flesh block&r, then lighting it on fire."
		""
		"{image:arphex:textures/mob_effect/voidlasher_chaos_control.png width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3A2B67E8C2DCF8F9.quest_subtitle: "&8&lhybrid of a tailless whip scorpion and a dragonfly."
	quest.3A2B67E8C2DCF8F9.title: "&lKill The Dragonic Voidlasher"
	quest.3ABFBCC89CD45BC3.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Deeper and Darker, a mod that aims to significantly enhance the Deep Dark biome in Minecraft. This mod adds many new features related to the Deep Dark and introduces a chilling new dimension: the Otherside."
		""
		"Your journey begins by surviving the enhanced Deep Dark and gathering the components needed to pierce the veil. Prepare for a dangerous exploration into the silence, where the Sculk reigns and the threats are far greater than before. 🕯️"
	]
	quest.3ABFBCC89CD45BC3.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Deeper and Darker Mod&r and find the path to the Otherside."
	quest.3ABFBCC89CD45BC3.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Welcome to Deeper and Darker 🌌🗝"
	quest.3AC3DC53D29C032A.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spider Snatcher is a strong, aggressive miniboss that spawns rarely in Dark Forests and Deep Dark biomes. This formidable creature, designed after the Black Widow, uses both powerful melee and devastating ranged attacks."
		""
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		""
		"Web Attacks: It has an extremely strong ranged web attack that applies a Webbed effect, stacking up to Level 5 Slowness if hit repeatedly."
		""
		"Invulnerability: It is completely immune to projectiles, forcing close-range combat."
		""
		"Minions: It can spawn Spider Snatcher Larvae to fight for it."
		""
		"Weakness: The recommended strategy is to move into a tight space where its large hitbox prevents it from reaching you, use a shield to block its ranged attacks, and a flamethrower to finish it off."
		""
		"Upon defeat, the Spider Snatcher drops Giant Spinnerets, which are used for crafting the Silk Slinger grappling hook."
	]
	quest.3AC3DC53D29C032A.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Spider Snatcher miniboss&r and claim its Giant Spinnerets."
	quest.3AC3DC53D29C032A.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Spider Snatcher"
	quest.3BE6F6B2DEF4B63F.quest_desc: [
		"&rTo progress further into Mobstein's resurrection science, you require a method to harvest specific components from the completed bodies. The Organ Extractor is the essential device for executing this procedure."
		""
		"To utilize the machine, you place any Full Body along with Tweezers onto the Extractor, which then randomly yields an organ from the creature's genetic tree. This machine is indispensable for obtaining the unique organ parts necessary for advanced crafting and final assembly of your creations!"
	]
	quest.3BE6F6B2DEF4B63F.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Organ Extractor&r to obtain crucial mob organ components."
	quest.3BE6F6B2DEF4B63F.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Organ Harvester"
	quest.3C399066CB8BDB81.quest_desc: [
		"Kill &2&lzombie clowns, pumpkin bruisers and barrel zombies&r to get &d&ltransmutating elixir&r. Then use the elixir on &4&linfernal evil pumpkin&r to spawn the lord."
		"{image:born_in_chaos_v1:item/lordpumpkinhead_icon width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3C399066CB8BDB81.quest_subtitle: "&l&4The Lord of the pumpkins"
	quest.3C399066CB8BDB81.title: "&l&2Kill The Lord Pumpkinhead"
	quest.3E66C4822CA11825.quest_desc: [
		"Kill &l&9undead mobs&r to get &b&lsouls stars&r. Throw one of those stars and it leads you to the &l&3lich tower&r in the ice biomes. Place four of the stars in &l&8four pedestals&r to summon the lich."
		"{image:bosses_of_mass_destruction:item/soul_star width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3E66C4822CA11825.quest_subtitle: "&l&3The magican of the night and ice."
	quest.3E66C4822CA11825.title: "&l&9Kill The Night Lich"
	quest.3E70097C207632D5.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Bomber (or \"Clogger\" by its explosive behavior) is a strong, challenging undead mob found anywhere in the Overworld. This true zombie is highly resistant to knockback and can move quite fast."
		""
		"Be extremely cautious when engaging, as its special attack is to explode and splatter goo on the victim's face. It typically jumps twice before detonating, and the explosion timer resets if you move too far away."
		""
		"To defeat it safely, try hitting it just as it is about to explode, which will cause it to burst instantly, preventing it from reaching you."
	]
	quest.3E70097C207632D5.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Clogger&r, the Bomber variant zombie."
	quest.3E70097C207632D5.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lEliminating the Clogger"
	quest.3F93774BBACD470A.quest_desc: ["&8&lThe Primordial Bone Crawler is the queen of all the Bone Crawlers. She controls the nest and lives inside a protected cocoon underground."]
	quest.3F93774BBACD470A.quest_subtitle: "&8&lThe Primordial Bone Crawler is the queen of all the Bone Crawlers."
	quest.3F93774BBACD470A.title: "&7&lKill The Primordial Crawler"
	quest.428FCD074CC027AB.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Corail Tombstone, a mod designed to save your sanity by securing your items upon death! This mod prevents the loss of all your hard-earned items by generating a tombstone at your precise location of death."
		""
		"Your quest begins with your first death. Once you perish, a tombstone will spawn, keeping your inventory safe until you return to retrieve it. This is your first step toward conquering the fear of losing everything! 💀"
	]
	quest.428FCD074CC027AB.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Corail Tombstone Mod&r and activate the death-saving mechanic."
	quest.428FCD074CC027AB.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eWelcome to Corail &6&lTombstone ⚰✨"
	quest.42C6CC6DD6426937.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.42C6CC6DD6426937.quest_subtitle: "&c&lA mysterious strcture found in staring hill"
	quest.42C6CC6DD6426937.title: "&4&lFind The Hivemind Chamber"
	quest.44C339BC86DFC460.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Wheezer is a zombie that exhales pink fumes, which block your vision and weaken your strength. However, you must now face its much stronger Lumber (Heavy) Variant."
		""
		"This variant deals massive damage and has an increased walk speed. Unlike the standard Wheezer, this dangerous variant cannot be decapitated, removing its main weakness."
		""
		"To defeat it, utilize its one remaining vulnerability: setting the Wheezer on fire instantly kills it. Use fire to your advantage and eliminate this heavily enhanced threat! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.44C339BC86DFC460.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Lumber Wheezer variant&r, the enhanced fumigating zombie."
	quest.44C339BC86DFC460.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lEliminating the Wheezer (heavy variant)"
	quest.4522596020732ACE.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Pumpkin Spirit (also known as Sir Pumpkinhead) is a powerful boss entity added to the mod. This boss is a huge Halloween-themed challenge."
		"The boss is summoned by destroying a naturally spawned Infernal Evil Pumpkin at night in the Overworld. Sir Pumpkinhead has three distinct phases:"
		"Phase 1: He is riding the Felsteed (a mount) and will repeatedly dash around, inflicting melee attacks that slow your movement. He also summons small, slow-flying Mr. Pumpkins."
		"Phase 2: He jumps from the Felsteed, which now chases you. Sir Pumpkinhead will fire explosions at you using the Pumpkin Staff."
		"Phase 3: His head detaches from his body, and you must fight both entities simultaneously."
		"Upon his final defeat, he drops the Soul Saber, Pumpkin Staff, and the Fel Lamp (used to summon the Felsteed mount). "
	]
	quest.4522596020732ACE.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Pumpkin Spirit&r boss and overcome the Halloween horror."
	quest.4522596020732ACE.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Pumpkin Spirit "
	quest.452B92C81F5F50B4.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Mace of Distortion is a powerful magical weapon capable of unleashing destructive energy. After mastering its use on hostile mobs, your next challenge is to test its power on another player."
		""
		"Coordinate with a friend or find a willing target on a server, and activate the Mace's ability. Successfully distort a player to understand the full, non-mob-specific impact of this artifact's arcane power! 🔮"
	]
	quest.452B92C81F5F50B4.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Distort a player&r with the Mace of Distortion."
	quest.452B92C81F5F50B4.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Targeting a Player 🔨👤"
	quest.4676F8B641D8C65C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Flesh Key is the crucial item needed to summon the final boss, the Gate Guardian. Once you find the Dimensional Gate arena, you must use this key to awaken him by right-clicking it on the keylock."
		""
		"Since the recipe is not detailed here, you are strongly encouraged to consult a guide like Just Enough Items (JEI) to find the exact crafting or acquisition process for this vital item. Prepare the key, and prepare for the ultimate fight for your freedom! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.4676F8B641D8C65C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Acquire a Flesh Key&r to awaken the Gate Guardian."
	quest.4676F8B641D8C65C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lAcquiring the Flesh Key"
	quest.469C5028CF9543B0.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Bosses of Mass Destruction, a mod that introduces new, challenging bosses across the Overworld, Nether, and End dimensions! Your adventure starts by seeking out these formidable foes."
		""
		"You will encounter bosses such as the Night Lich, Obsidilith, Nether Gauntlet, and Void Blossom. Some bosses, like the Night Lich, can be found in unique structures like the Lich Tower, which may even be converted into an interesting-looking base. Defeating these threats will reward you with extremely powerful items, such as a pillar that grants creative flight or a Spear that allows you to teleport through solid blocks. Prepare for mass destruction! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.469C5028CF9543B0.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Bosses of Mass Destruction Mod&r and begin the hunt."
	quest.469C5028CF9543B0.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cWelcome to Bosses of Mass Destruction 💥👑"
	quest.46DA98186FE49C6B.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Arthropleura Abomination is a massive, venomous centipede boss that commands significant fear. This creature represents a major challenge in the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."
		""
		"This boss utilizes powerful venom-based attacks and has high resilience, making it a difficult foe to take down. You must hunt down the Arthropleura Abomination to acquire its unique and valuable drops, which are often necessary for crafting powerful, high-tier armor and tools in the mod. Prepare for a brutal, venomous battle! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.46DA98186FE49C6B.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Arthropleura Abomination&r, the venomous centipede boss."
	quest.46DA98186FE49C6B.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Arthropleura Abomination 🐛💥"
	quest.47BD22A321C1E3BF.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Disemboweler is a large, monstrous zombie characterized by its exposed entrails, and it seeks both blood and vengeance. This terrifying creature can be found lumbering around the Overworld, searching for players and cows to consume."
		""
		"This enemy is dangerous, as its attacks pack a heavy punch. Upon defeat, the Disemboweler drops a valuable item called a \"deathly heart\". Slay this monstrosity and claim its vital organ!"
	]
	quest.47BD22A321C1E3BF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Disemboweler&r, the large, blood-seeking zombie."
	quest.47BD22A321C1E3BF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Disemboweler"
	quest.481B0AC21602E360.quest_desc: ["&rThe Scorpioid Bloodluster is a massive, highly dangerous miniboss that draws its power from blood magic. This creature is relentless, posing a severe challenge to adventurers in the Arthropod Phobia Expansions mod."]
	quest.481B0AC21602E360.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Scorpioid Bloodluster miniboss&r and survive its relentless blood magic."
	quest.481B0AC21602E360.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Scorpioid Bloodluster 🦂🩸"
	quest.4A9ABC51037B6110.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Cursed Amulet is a powerful magical item used to summon one of the dimension's bosses, the Damned Templar. This amulet is crafted using Crosses that can be found in the Churches within Limbo."
		""
		"While the Damned Templar can spawn rarely in cold biomes, crafting the Amulet provides a reliable way to challenge him and secure the Templar Artifact. Forge this amulet and prepare for a challenging boss fight! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.4A9ABC51037B6110.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Cursed Amulet&r to summon the Damned Templar boss."
	quest.4A9ABC51037B6110.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Cursed Amulet "
	quest.4B21FADA1189ECE6.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spirit Guide is an undead and spirit creature found in dry and hot biomes. It does not burn in the sun due to the hat it wears."
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		"Magic Depletion: The monster's attacks impose the effect of Magic Depletion."
		"Summoning Helpers: During the battle, it can also call on its helpers."
		"Strengthening: A successful attack on a player will strengthen his assistants."
		"Defeat the Spirit Guide quickly to prevent it from weakening your magic and overwhelming you with strengthened minions!"
	]
	quest.4B21FADA1189ECE6.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Spirit Guide&r, the magic-depleting undead."
	quest.4B21FADA1189ECE6.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Spirit Guide "
	quest.4B876496EC16BA71.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe specialized process of reviving enhanced mobs demands materials that bridge the concepts of life and decay. Descomposed Leather is a key component required for many of the mod's initial items and resurrection processes."
		""
		"You must find the means to acquire this strange leather, whether it is through mob drops, new crafting recipes, or by performing a specific action with vanilla items. Secure this material to initiate your necromantic work and bring the ancient beasts back to life!"
	]
	quest.4B876496EC16BA71.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain Descomposed Leather&r, a vital material for the necromantic arts."
	quest.4B876496EC16BA71.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Essential Hide"
	quest.4BFC2F45D0E3A177.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.4BFC2F45D0E3A177.quest_subtitle: "&l&7A mysterious structure found in crawler nest."
	quest.4BFC2F45D0E3A177.title: "&l&8Find The Primordial Nest"
	quest.4C5ED8F3C221C6C8.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Ancient City is the massive, silent structure that serves as the heart of the Deep Dark biome. To find it, you must delve deep underground."
		""
		"You will know you are close when you begin encountering dense concentrations of Sculk, which blanket the area. Successfully finding this sprawling ruin is the critical first step toward confronting the Warden and mastering the challenges of the Deeper and Darker mod. 🕯️"
	]
	quest.4C5ED8F3C221C6C8.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Locate an Ancient City structure&r within the deep dark."
	quest.4C5ED8F3C221C6C8.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Descent into the &5Ancient City&r 🌃🔍"
	quest.4D2CDF6DE7A1DE07.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Dread Hound is a formidable and fast undead canine, representing a dangerous threat in the darkness. This creature is characterized by its terrifying appearance and agility, making it a difficult target to engage in direct combat."
		"You must locate the area where the Dread Hound resides and prepare for a swift battle against its aggressive, powerful attacks. Defeat this undead beast to secure its valuable drops! "
	]
	quest.4D2CDF6DE7A1DE07.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Dread Hound&r, the terrifying, quick undead dog."
	quest.4D2CDF6DE7A1DE07.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Dread Hound "
	quest.4D9F10EA9E1E4F78.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to The Undead Revamped, a mod that introduces strong and challenging undead mobs to make Minecraft significantly more difficult. These new zombies have many different skills, including ramming and exploding, turning every encounter into a dangerous choice."
		""
		"Your first quest is to begin your survival against these terrifying foes. While these mobs are pretty scary and will force you to choose escape over fighting at first, remember that they all have their own weaknesses that you can exploit to defeat them with ease! 🩸"
	]
	quest.4D9F10EA9E1E4F78.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover The Undead Revamped Mod&r and face the new challenges."
	quest.4D9F10EA9E1E4F78.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4&lWelcome to The &c&lUndead &r&lRevamped"
	quest.4E3BC7752AFDCDF7.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Born in Chaos, a mod that aims to diversify and complicate your survival by adding many new aggressive mobs! This modification adds a variety of opponents that require a ** specific approach and tactics**."
		"Your journey begins with fear: you will once again have a sense of fear of going out at night and exploring dark caves, because now there will be dangers everywhere. The mod introduces a new boss, weapons and armor, decorative blocks, and new structures."
		"Since all mobs and structures spawn in all biomes (including those from other mods), danger is truly everywhere! Prepare for combat, as this mod is compatible with Better Combat to make the system more dynamic."
	]
	quest.4E3BC7752AFDCDF7.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Born in Chaos Mod&r and face the new dangers."
	quest.4E3BC7752AFDCDF7.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Welcome to Born &c&l in &8&lChaos 👹🔥"
	quest.4E9E60AFE0AE7B2B.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spectre is a dangerous \"Made zombie\" found in certain snowy biomes. This enemy is extremely fast and possesses thick armor."
		""
		"Key Mechanics and Weaknesses:"
		""
		"Invincibility: The Spectre is always invincible until it takes damage, at which point its invincibility is only temporarily disabled."
		""
		"Rush Attack: After being attacked, it will sometimes rush toward you."
		""
		"Armor Breaking: Hitting it can break its tanks, which spreads invincible smoke around, causing everything nearby to become invisible (so avoid hurting it when other zombies are around)."
		""
		"Be aware that the Spectre is generally resistant to physical attacks, so utilizing magic or elemental damage is recommended to secure the kill."
	]
	quest.4E9E60AFE0AE7B2B.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Spectre&r, the invincible, high-speed undead."
	quest.4E9E60AFE0AE7B2B.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Spectre"
	quest.4EB2258B88E247BF.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Mace of Distortion is a powerful magical weapon that is essential for crowd control in EvilCraft. When activated, this mace unleashes a destructive force that can distort, or damage, many enemies in an area."
		""
		"Your goal is to test the full destructive potential of the mace by gathering a large group of enemies and activating its ability. Successfully distort over ten mobs simultaneously to prove your mastery over the mace's arcane power! 🔮"
	]
	quest.4EB2258B88E247BF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Distort over ten mobs at once&r with the Mace of Distortion."
	quest.4EB2258B88E247BF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Mass Distortion 💥🔨"
	quest.4EE93FC2EB5661D6.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Zombie Nightmare Expansions (ZoNiEx), a new horror mod focused on adding undead monsters with unique nightmarish mechanics. This mod makes Minecraft highly challenging and works well with horror, RPG, and hardcore gameplay styles."
		""
		"Your first quest is to encounter the terrifying new enemies! These mobs spawn rarely in Overworld biomes. You will encounter foes like the huge, blood-seeking Disemboweler, the camouflaged Skin Crawler, and the massive Brutaliser mini-boss. Prepare your defenses and survive the nightmare!"
	]
	quest.4EE93FC2EB5661D6.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Zombie Nightmare Expansions Mod&r and face the new undead horrors."
	quest.4EE93FC2EB5661D6.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Welcome to Zombie &a&lNightmare"
	quest.4FA4C042C73273EC.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour quest to fully revive Dr. Mobstenio begins by finding his secret laboratory. The Frankenstein Castle is a unique structure specifically located in the Swamp biome."
		""
		"This castle is the secret laboratory of Dr. Mobstenio, who is the creator of the Frankenstein Golem and the source of the mod's crazy inventions. You must visit this structure to secure the doctor's secret and continue the journey to bring him back to life!"
	]
	quest.4FA4C042C73273EC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Visit the Frankenstein Castle structure&r found in the Swamp biome."
	quest.4FA4C042C73273EC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Hidden Laboratory"
	quest.5056F00FC7EB427E.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Zombie Fisherman appears near bodies of water. This enemy does not burn in the sun, as it hides behind its hat."
		"It attacks the player by throwing rotten fish, which causes a long-lasting Rotten Stink effect. This monster has the highest chance of summoning maggots after its death. Find this water-bound foe and eliminate it"
	]
	quest.5056F00FC7EB427E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Zombie Fisherman&r, the fish-wielding undead."
	quest.5056F00FC7EB427E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Zombie Fisherman"
	quest.51ED6802DBE06C1C.quest_desc: [
		"&rUpon death and the placement of your grave, the mod provides you with a Grave Key. This specialized item is essential for easily locating and managing your lost items."
		""
		"The key points you directly to the location of the Tombstone where your inventory is safely stored. Acquire and use the Grave Key to complete the final step of item retrieval and safely recover your inventory! 🧭"
	]
	quest.51ED6802DBE06C1C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain a Grave Key&r to locate and retrieve your Tombstone."
	quest.51ED6802DBE06C1C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Grave Key 🗝⚰"
	quest.535B4DCBE354C7CF.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Voodoo Poppet is a powerful magical item in the Corail Tombstone mod, serving as a talisman for resurrection and protection magic."
		""
		"While the exact recipe is not listed here, this item is typically crafted by combining bone-related materials and other components associated with the mod's arcane focus. Forge this poppet to gain an essential tool for cheating death and utilizing advanced resurrection features! 💀"
	]
	quest.535B4DCBE354C7CF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Voodoo Poppet&r for resurrection and protection magic."
	quest.535B4DCBE354C7CF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Voodoo Poppet 🗿✨"
	quest.536740B2E07C1473.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour mission for vengeance and revival requires a journey to the eerie Witherstein Ruins, a structure found exclusively in the Jungle biome. This location is vital, as it is connected to the dark history of the Witherstein—the creature who betrayed the monsters and corrupted the original Wither."
		""
		"You must visit these ruins to continue your mission to avenge Dr. Mobstenio and prepare for his eventual resurrection. Beware the dangers hidden within this forgotten structure!"
	]
	quest.536740B2E07C1473.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Visit the Witherstein Ruins structure&r located specifically in the Jungle biome."
	quest.536740B2E07C1473.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Witherstein Vengeance"
	quest.541584B9C6EA963D.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Skeleton Demoman is similar to the Decrepit Skeleton, but it does not burn in the sun. This enemy poses a serious threat due to its unique detonation ability."
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		"Detonation: When its health drops to a certain limit, the Demoman starts detonating."
		"Window of Opportunity: During the detonation sequence, the monster does not move, giving you an opportunity to kill it before the explosion or manage to run away from the blast."
		"Be prepared to take advantage of its momentary pause to defeat it before it explodes"
	]
	quest.541584B9C6EA963D.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Skeleton Demoman&r and avoid its timed explosion."
	quest.541584B9C6EA963D.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Skeleton Demoman"
	quest.54747696DB1CEC64.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour exploration of the haunting Limbo dimension requires finding unique landmarks. The Chapel is a significant structure that may offer clues or resources in this otherwise empty world."
		""
		"You must be extremely careful while searching, as the structure is rumored to be guarded by Banshees, spectral enemies who will attempt to possess you. Locate the chapel, but be ready for a dangerous fight against these terrifying spirits! 👻"
	]
	quest.54747696DB1CEC64.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Find the Chapel structure&r in the terrifying Limbo dimension."
	quest.54747696DB1CEC64.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lLocating the Chapel "
	quest.54E696511EA9D2B5.quest_desc: [
		"&rDarksteel is the main ore of Limbo, serving as a powerful material that is slightly better than iron and applies a brief Wither effect to enemies. You must forge a set of this armor to survive the horrors of the dimension:"
		"Light Darksteel Armor: This variant costs Darksteel and Ripped Cloth (obtained from Ghouls). It makes you lighter, increasing your speed and jump height, while reducing fall damage. It comes in red and black variants."
		"Heavy Darksteel Armor: This variant offers more protection (even slightly better than Netherite), but it is more expensive and will slow you down due to the weight."
		"Choose the armor that fits your playstyle and forge this essential protection!"
	]
	quest.54E696511EA9D2B5.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a full set of Darksteel Armor&r, choosing between the Light or Heavy variant."
	quest.54E696511EA9D2B5.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Forging Darksteel Armor"
	quest.5681F8BE2B704DFE.quest_desc: ["&rThe Centipede Evictor is a huge, strong miniboss with an intricate model and realistic animations, based on real-life cave centipedes."]
	quest.5681F8BE2B704DFE.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Centipede Evictor miniboss&r, the huge, home-invading arthropod."
	quest.5681F8BE2B704DFE.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Centipede Evictor 🐛🏠"
	quest.569910FDD3A3AD30.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Missionary is a large, powerful boss, often appearing as an intimidating, religious figure. This entity is an original boss added by the mod."
		"The Missionary is a formidable enemy with a large health pool and a strong armor. You must locate the structure or area where the Missionary resides and prepare for a long, tactical battle. Defeat this powerful divine figure to claim its valuable rewards! "
	]
	quest.569910FDD3A3AD30.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Missionary&r, the divine foe from the Overworld."
	quest.569910FDD3A3AD30.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Missionary"
	quest.56A1E15E528CD87E.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Void Blossom is the newest boss added to the mod, found in rare caves at the bottom of the world. You can locate the correct cave by following the direction indicated by Void Lilies."
		""
		"This boss is protected by a permanent Thorns effect and has powerful abilities:"
		""
		"It can spawn Thorn bushes that deal damage."
		""
		"It can regenerate from nearby Void Blossoms, which you must destroy in order to defeat the boss."
		""
		"It can also spawn poisonous green particle clouds."
		""
		"Once defeated, you will be rewarded with Crystal Fruit and a Void Thorn."
	]
	quest.56A1E15E528CD87E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Void Blossom&r boss found in caves at the bottom of the world."
	quest.56A1E15E528CD87E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cSlaying the Void Blossom"
	quest.59FF0A9B10669830.quest_desc: [
		"&rRipped Cloth is a necessary material for crafting the Light Darksteel Armor, which gives unique mobility bonuses. This cloth is obtained as a drop from a common mob found wandering the Limbo dimension:"
		""
		"Slay Ghouls: These are the common mobs found roaming Limbo."
		""
		"Loot the Drops: Ghouls drop Ripped Cloth (along with Cursed Bones) upon death."
		""
		"Once you have the Ripped Cloth, you can combine it with Darksteel to craft the Light Darksteel Armor, available in red and black variants. This armor will make you lighter, allowing you to jump higher, speed up, and reduce fall damage. 💀"
	]
	quest.59FF0A9B10669830.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain Ripped Cloth&r by slaying the common Ghouls in Limbo."
	quest.59FF0A9B10669830.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lAcquiring Ripped Cloth "
	quest.5CDDF5A03C1ED327.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Nightmare's Embrace is a highly powerful, often endgame, armor set that provides superior protection against the horrors of the mod."
		"To forge this unique armor, you will need to utilize rare materials acquired from some of the most dangerous boss entities, such as the Tormentor or the Draconic Voidlasher. Crafting this set signifies a major step toward dominating the most terrifying aspects of the mod! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.5CDDF5A03C1ED327.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Nightmare's Embrace armor set&r."
	quest.5CDDF5A03C1ED327.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Nightmare's Embrace"
	quest.5D70391FD11BA31A.quest_desc: [
		"&rDarksteel is the fundamental ore of the Limbo dimension, serving as the essential material for high-tier gear. You must mine the raw Darksteel Ore (found in the caves of Limbo) and smelt it into Darksteel Ingots."
		"Gather a total of ten Darksteel Ingots to meet the requirements for complex recipes, such as forging the powerful Light or Heavy Darksteel Armor! "
	]
	quest.5D70391FD11BA31A.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain 10 Darksteel Ingots&r for advanced crafting."
	quest.5D70391FD11BA31A.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Mining for Dark Metal"
	quest.5D995307DC65F95E.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to the central mechanic of Corail Tombstone! Upon your first death, a Tombstone (or grave) was instantly generated at the exact location where you perished."
		""
		"This grave is a crucial marker, as it protects your entire inventory, preventing the loss of all your items. Your goal is to navigate back to the spot of your death, locate your first grave, and safely retrieve your belongings! 🧭"
	]
	quest.5D995307DC65F95E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Find the Tombstone erected at your place of death&r."
	quest.5D995307DC65F95E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe First Grave ⚰📍"
	quest.5DC4BB3BF6FEB914.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Witherstein is a corrupted foe, known as the creator of the original Wither mob, who ultimately betrayed and corrupted the monsters. This boss resides in the Witherstein Ruins, which are located in the Jungle biome."
		""
		"You must challenge and defeat the Witherstein to avenge Dr. Mobstenio and prepare for his eventual return to life. Upon its defeat, the Witherstein drops Syringe Mobstenio Blood, a critical item required to finally revive the doctor!"
	]
	quest.5DC4BB3BF6FEB914.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Witherstein boss in its Ruins&r."
	quest.5DC4BB3BF6FEB914.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Ultimate Vengeance"
	quest.5E41418D7ACB450C.quest_desc: [
		"&rSir Pumpkinhead (also known as the Pumpkin Spirit) is a powerful boss that is summoned by destroying a naturally spawned Infernal Evil Pumpkin at night in the Overworld."
		"The boss fight has three phases:"
		"Phase 1: He is riding the Felsteed (a mount) and will repeatedly dash around while launching melee attacks that slow your movement. He also summons small, slow-flying Mr. Pumpkins."
		"Phase 2: He jumps from the Felsteed (which now chases you) and will fire explosions at you using the Pumpkin Staff."
		"Phase 3: His head detaches from his body, and you must fight both the head and the body simultaneously."
		"Upon his final defeat, he drops the Soul Saber, Pumpkin Staff, and the Fel Lamp (used to summon the Felsteed mount)."
	]
	quest.5E41418D7ACB450C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat Sir Pumpkinhead&r, the Pumpkin Spirit boss, and survive his three phases."
	quest.5E41418D7ACB450C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying Sir Pumpkinhead "
	quest.5E41828F1E32C34F.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Barrel Zombie (or \"Zombie Piñata\") is a unique type of zombie found primarily near water bodies. This enemy is protected from sunlight and has increased armor. Unlike ordinary zombies, it does not drown."
		"This monster is worth hunting because a wide variety of items can fall out of it—from complete garbage to extremely rare and valuable things. You must defeat the Barrel Zombie to test your luck and see what treasures it holds!"
	]
	quest.5E41828F1E32C34F.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Barrel Zombie&r to obtain valuable or rare items."
	quest.5E41828F1E32C34F.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Zombie Piñata "
	quest.5E5E578D754E0985.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Thunder Sword is a weapon of godly power, designed to strike lightning and defeat the Gate Guardian. To complete this powerful sword, you must forge its final component: the Handle."
		""
		"The entire sword requires multiple high-tier components, including Darksteel, Thunder Gems, and the Templar Artifact. The Handle serves to anchor these powerful arcane materials. Consult your crafting guides (like JEI) for the specific recipe for the Handle, and prepare to assemble your destiny! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.5E5E578D754E0985.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Thunder Sword Handle&r, the grounding piece for the ultimate weapon."
	quest.5E5E578D754E0985.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Thunder Sword Handle"
	quest.5FBF4D0551792E41.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Horror is a powerful entity—a Universal Discrepancy being—that spawns anywhere in the Overworld. This fast mob has 45 HP and deals 12 attack damage."
		""
		"Be extremely vigilant, as the Horror is difficult to track:"
		""
		"It constantly warps in and out of existence."
		""
		"It inflicts blindness upon getting hit."
		""
		"It spawns decoys to confuse you."
		""
		"Key Weaknesses: When near a light source, the real Horror will be spotted. While it's invisible, look at your feet, as it leaves Ender Dragon breath trails when it moves. The real one also takes extra knockback, which you can use to your advantage."
	]
	quest.5FBF4D0551792E41.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Horror&r, the Universal Discrepancy being."
	quest.5FBF4D0551792E41.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lSlaying the Horror"
	quest.61825FD1D61FEC39.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Zombie Clown is a slow and dense enemy. Its primary danger lies in its attacks, which smash an Intoxicating Decoction on the enemy. This decoction slows down the victim and causes short-term poisoning and dizziness."
		"Be careful when its health drops below half: it will break a bottle of Stimulating Decoction under its feet, which increases the movement speed of all monsters around it, including itself. Eliminate this disruptive foe quickly! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.61825FD1D61FEC39.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Zombie Clown&r and avoid its intoxicating concoctions."
	quest.61825FD1D61FEC39.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Cursed Clown "
	quest.622502423FA931D8.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Mobstein, a mod that gives new life to some of Minecraft's most underrated mobs! Through a unique resurrection process, you can revive enhanced versions of creatures like Axolotls, Dolphins, Ocelots, Bats, and even Golems."
		""
		"Each resurrected creature gains unique abilities and behaviors that expand your gameplay. Your journey begins by learning the magic of this mod and creating the tools necessary to bring these enhanced beasts back from the brink! 🐾"
	]
	quest.622502423FA931D8.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Mobstein Mod&r and begin the resurrection process."
	quest.622502423FA931D8.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eWelcome to Mobstein"
	quest.62DF0937CDED76AF.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Thunder Sword is a weapon of godly power, and it is the only thing that can damage the final boss, the Gate Guardian."
		""
		"To craft this legendary weapon, you need to combine Darksteel, Thunder Gems, and the Templar Artifact."
		""
		"Once crafted, this sword grants immense power in combat:"
		""
		"Charging: Each hit you land charges the sword up by 7, with a maximum charge of 150."
		""
		"Releasing Power: By right-clicking, you can release the charge, which immobilizes you but grants a godly regeneration and huge resistance."
		""
		"Area Damage: When the charge is released, all nearby entities will get damaged."
		""
		"Duration: The bigger the charge, the longer the powerful effect lasts."
		""
		"Wield this power carefully and use it to escape Limbo! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.62DF0937CDED76AF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the legendary Thunder Sword&r, the only weapon that can harm the Gate Guardian."
	quest.62DF0937CDED76AF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Thunder Sword"
	quest.62E59575DBDA3181.quest_desc: [
		"&rSir Pumpkinhead (also known as the Pumpkin Spirit) is a powerful boss that can be summoned by destroying a naturally spawned Infernal Evil Pumpkin at night in the Overworld."
		"In the final and most critical phase of the fight, the boss's head detaches from his body. To achieve final victory, you must focus your attack on this severed part, fighting both the body and the head simultaneously. Successfully destroy his head to end his reign of terror! "
	]
	quest.62E59575DBDA3181.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat Lord Pumpkinhead by destroying his detached head&r."
	quest.62E59575DBDA3181.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Decapitating Lord Pumpkinhead"
	quest.6395D593666498CC.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour first critical step toward locating the dangerous Night Lich boss is by acquiring the Soul Star. This unique item functions as a compass, pointing the way to the Lich's rare tower structures."
		""
		"Fortunately, the Soul Star can be obtained early in your adventure, as it is dropped by killing Undead mobs, such as Zombies and Skeletons. Begin hunting these common foes to secure the key to finding your first boss!"
	]
	quest.6395D593666498CC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain a Soul Star&r by slaying an Undead mob."
	quest.6395D593666498CC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cSeeking the Soul Star"
	quest.63C278322B54E8A7.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Arthropod Phobia Expansions (ArPhEx), a popular horror and adventure mod that introduces a wide range of creepy arthropods and terrifying demonic boss entities!"
		""
		"Your journey begins now by navigating a world filled with these new creatures. The mod features various unique mobs and powerful items with diverse abilities. Prepare your defenses and steel your nerves, for the world is now crawling with new horrors! 🕷️"
	]
	quest.63C278322B54E8A7.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Arthropod Phobia Expansions Mod&r and face the new horrors."
	quest.63C278322B54E8A7.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eWelcome to Arthropod &6&lHorror"
	quest.63E5363943AF348C.quest_desc: [
		"summonable by placing a soul sand block on top of a &c&lmangled spider flesh block&r, then lighting it on fire."
		""
		"{image:arphex:item/abyssalcrystal width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.63E5363943AF348C.quest_subtitle: "&c&lhybrid of a spider and a moth."
	quest.63E5363943AF348C.title: "&4&lKill The Spider Moth"
	quest.6613213896B34609.quest_desc: [
		"summonable by placing a soul sand block on top of a &5&lmangled scorpion flesh block&r, then lighting it on fire."
		""
		"{image:arphex:item/fireopal width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6613213896B34609.quest_subtitle: "&5&lhybrid of a scorpion and a mosquito"
	quest.6613213896B34609.title: "&l&7Kill The Scorpioid Bloodluster"
	quest.6614DB4B38CF3759.quest_desc: [
		"&l&4A culmination of living flesh, bones and sinew. Once a great sage of the cult, now reduced to this pathetic pile of horrid meat due to the infection. It controls the entirety of the Hivemind that"
		"&l&4composes the Deathgrounds. "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&l&4It can see everything, feel everything, control everything. Some crazed members would find it a blessing, being one with the Flesh: it means being one step closer to the Void."
	]
	quest.6614DB4B38CF3759.quest_subtitle: "&l&cA culmination of living flesh, bones and sinew."
	quest.6614DB4B38CF3759.title: "&4&lKill The Misanthropic Hivemind"
	quest.6714BE401C626AFC.quest_desc: [
		"&rDarksteel Ore is the main metal you will find in the caves of the Limbo dimension. It is the foundation for crafting the mod's powerful armor and exotic weapons, as it gives a brief Wither effect to enemies."
		""
		"You must smelt the raw Darksteel Ore in a furnace to obtain the usable Darksteel Ingot. Once you have the ingots, you can begin forging the light or heavy Darksteel armors! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.6714BE401C626AFC.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Smelt Darksteel Ore&r into a Darksteel Ingot."
	quest.6714BE401C626AFC.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Darksteel Ingot "
	quest.67438987D9452F1F.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Ankh of Prayer is a mystical and powerful item central to the late-game magic of Corail Tombstone. This relic is often tied to resurrection, teleportation, or granting special blessings."
		""
		"The recipe for the Ankh is typically complex, requiring materials acquired from deep progression within the mod. Forge this powerful amulet to unlock new capabilities and strengthen your arcane mastery! 🔮"
	]
	quest.67438987D9452F1F.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Ankh of Prayer a powerful relic of the mod."
	quest.67438987D9452F1F.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eForging the Ankh of Prayer 🙏✨"
	quest.6832627EF95EA853.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Obsidilith is a powerful boss found in rare structures across the End Islands dimension. This boss uses Elemental attacks that apply various debuffs to the player."
		""
		"To succeed in this difficult fight, you must carefully learn the attack patterns of the Obsidilith. Once this boss is defeated, it will spawn a small Obsidian Tower containing a Shulker Box of loot."
	]
	quest.6832627EF95EA853.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Obsidilith&r boss found in rare structures in the End."
	quest.6832627EF95EA853.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cSlaying the Obsidilith"
	quest.6842BD03E015A687.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Hunter is a challenging Demonic Undead mob, typically found at 78+ heights in the Overworld or underground. This fast mob loves to fly to confuse its target and avoid getting hit."
		""
		"Be warned: it is a tricky opponent because it fully recovers its health after dealing damage (unless the attack is blocked). After hitting its target, it will momentarily fly away and then come back again."
		""
		"Exploit its weaknesses: When it is chasing you, try going near cliffs or deep rivers, as it cannot stop mid-flight and may fall. Also, it is vulnerable when flying, so try flanking it mid-air."
	]
	quest.6842BD03E015A687.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the tricky Hunter&r, the fast, flying undead."
	quest.6842BD03E015A687.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lSlaying the Hunter"
	quest.69EB109A10AF512E.quest_desc: [
		"&rDespite its shabby appearance, the Fallen Chaos Knight remains an extremely dangerous adversary. This enemy is formidable, possessing a high rate of armor and high speed of movement. It also has protection from arrows and sunlight."
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		"Cursed Mark: It places a Cursed Mark on any victim it attacks."
		"Minion Spawn: When the mark expires, up to four Scarlet Persecutors will spawn around the cursed spot."
		"You must defeat this heavily armored, fast foe and mitigate the risk of being overwhelmed by the Scarlet Persecutors it summons! "
	]
	quest.69EB109A10AF512E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Fallen Chaos Knight&r, the swift and heavily armored adversary."
	quest.69EB109A10AF512E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Fallen Chaos Knight "
	quest.6BDA57C118E98F4E.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spitter is a fast, true zombie found anywhere in the Overworld. This mob possesses a dangerous ranged attack and uses the environment to its advantage."
		""
		"Key Behaviors and Weaknesses:"
		""
		"Hiding: The Spitter hides underground when it has no target, making it difficult to spot."
		""
		"Poor Sight: Its sight is worse than most zombies, which you can exploit. Try using a bow to attack them before they notice you."
		""
		"Drops: They rarely drop an Acid Sack, which you can throw to spread acid on impact. The Acid Sack can also be crafted into a Napalm Sack (by combining it with Slime) or used to make a Debuff Resistance Tea."
		""
		"Utilize your ranged weapons to defeat this tricky undead before it has a chance to hide!"
	]
	quest.6BDA57C118E98F4E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the speedy Spitter&r, the projectile-using zombie."
	quest.6BDA57C118E98F4E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lSlaying the Spitter"
	quest.6C334F1D694E1DDB.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spirit Furnace is a key utility block in EvilCraft, serving as an upgrade to the standard furnace. This specialized furnace uses dark energy to speed up the smelting process."
		""
		"To craft the Spirit Furnace, you will need to combine the fundamental resources of the mod, including Dark Gems and basic furnace components. Forge this enhanced furnace to significantly accelerate your material processing and power your arcane industry! 🔮"
	]
	quest.6C334F1D694E1DDB.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Spirit Furnace&r, the enhanced spiritual smelter."
	quest.6C334F1D694E1DDB.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Forging the Spirit Furnace 🔥👻"
	quest.6CD61D4F15336633.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Royal Hunter is a rare and stronger variant of the fast-flying Hunter mob. These undead archers are much more well-fed than their lesser counterparts and are generally a bit stronger."
		""
		"Like the standard Hunter, this mob is fast, loves to fly to confuse you, and fully recovers its health after dealing damage (unless blocked)."
		""
		"The Royal Hunters are valuable targets because they drop extra experience upon defeat. Slay this airborne threat to gain a significant XP reward!"
	]
	quest.6CD61D4F15336633.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Royal Hunter variant&r, the well-fed undead archer."
	quest.6CD61D4F15336633.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lEliminating the Royal"
	quest.6E64B5D9C250347C.quest_desc: [
		"&rMonster Skin is a necessary material for crafting various items, likely used in the creation of unique armor or tools that grant protection against the game's new threats."
		"You must engage in combat against hostile mobs, as this material is typically acquired as a drop from slain creatures. Gather a total of sixteen Monster Skins to meet the requirements for advanced, high-tier gear in the mod! "
	]
	quest.6E64B5D9C250347C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain 16 Monster Skins&r for crafting enhanced gear."
	quest.6E64B5D9C250347C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Harvesting Monster Skins "
	quest.6F816F6BB6DF442A.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Templar Artifact is an essential ingredient required to craft the legendary Thunder Sword, the only weapon capable of harming the final boss, the Gate Guardian. This artifact is dropped by the Damned Templar, a challenging boss that rarely spawns in cold biomes."
		""
		"To guarantee an encounter, you can summon the Damned Templar by crafting and using a Cursed Amulet. Secure this powerful artifact to unlock the final stage of your weapon progression! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.6F816F6BB6DF442A.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Obtain the Templar Artifact&r, a core material for the Thunder Sword."
	quest.6F816F6BB6DF442A.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lAcquiring the Templar Artifact"
	quest.6FE63FF900CACC2C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spider Infestor is a large, repulsive mob that aims to corrupt the environment around it. This creature is often found in the darkest areas, ready to turn harmless spaces into hostile, web-filled territory."
		""
		"This mob poses a threat not just through direct combat, but by infesting structures and terrain. You must hunt down and defeat the Spider Infestor to claim its valuable drops, which are typically used for crafting powerful, high-tier armor and tools. Eliminate this source of infestation! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.6FE63FF900CACC2C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Spider Infestor&r and prevent the spread of the infestation."
	quest.6FE63FF900CACC2C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Spider Infestor 🕷🤢"
	quest.714048331407D7A8.quest_subtitle: "Hey!"
	quest.725A81E4655F97EF.quest_desc: [
		"You can fight this beast by first crafting the &l&fbone altar&r using &b&lmoonstone&r and &l&0peeker antlers.&r"
		""
		"{image:under_the_moon:item/cursed_artifact width:50 height:50 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Then you have to make tower consisting of &l&bmoonstone block&r at the bottom, bone block in the middle and the altar on top. Then you have to place four redstone torches on the sides of the bone block. The only thing to do is throw the &l&4cursed artifact&r on top of the altar."
	]
	quest.725A81E4655F97EF.quest_subtitle: "&l&3A scary spirit of the creep forest"
	quest.725A81E4655F97EF.title: "&b&lKill The Wendigo"
	quest.728FEE8C7A770728.quest_desc: [
		"&rHaving mastered the forbidden arts, your next test is to apply your necromantic power in combat against another player. The Necromancer Staff is a powerful item that allows you to summon zombies to fight for you."
		""
		"Engage another player and utilize the staff's ability to summon an undead horde. The goal is to successfully attack the player with the zombies that you have raised from the dead. Prove that you can command the ranks of the undead! 🔮"
	]
	quest.728FEE8C7A770728.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Attack a player using zombies spawned from a Necromancer Staff&r."
	quest.728FEE8C7A770728.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&8Necromantic Assault 🧟‍♂️👤"
	quest.7457020C59C0035C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Warden is the terrifying sentinel of the Deep Dark, and defeating it is the ultimate act of defiance in this dimension."
		""
		"Your goal is to eliminate this powerful boss and claim its pulsing core. The Heart of the Deep is a unique item that drops with a 100% chance upon the Warden's defeat. This Heart is essential, as it is used to ignite the Otherside Portal. Prepare for the fight, as success in this quest unlocks the path to the next dimension! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.7457020C59C0035C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Warden and claim its Heart of the Deep&r."
	quest.7457020C59C0035C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Heart of the Deep 💔👑"
	quest.7630C7A56F719E0D.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &l&cmassive arena similar to bastion&r in the &l&4nether. Then you have to break &8&lthe monolith in the middle&r to fight the gauntlet"
		""
		"{image:bosses_of_mass_destruction:item/blazing_eye width:50 height:50 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7630C7A56F719E0D.quest_subtitle: "&4&lA gauntlet of the nether"
	quest.7630C7A56F719E0D.title: "&6&lKill The Netherite Gauntlet"
	quest.7651D234054F3275.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Nightmare Stalker is a terrifying boss entity that is synonymous with relentless pursuit and psychological horror. This boss is known for its ability to stalk players across the dimension, making escape difficult."
		"You must locate the area where the Nightmare Stalker resides and prepare for a sustained, high-stress battle. Its attacks often involve psychic or fear-inducing effects, forcing you to maintain mental fortitude and quick movement. Defeat this relentless foe to secure its unique and valuable drops! "
	]
	quest.7651D234054F3275.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Nightmare Stalker boss&r and evade its terrifying pursuit."
	quest.7651D234054F3275.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Nightmare Stalker"
	quest.76D37CF58ECE345F.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Bonescaller is a formidable skeleton enemy that uses a magic staff as a weapon. This foe attacks from a distance, attempting to keep the player away from it."
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		"Summoning: During the battle, the Bonescaller can call on several Baby Skeletons to help it."
		"Disabling Summons: You can disable the skeleton's ability to summon minions if you manage to set it on fire or apply a magical drain effect to it."
		"Use fire or magic to interrupt its ability to summon aid, and defeat this ranged threat! "
	]
	quest.76D37CF58ECE345F.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Bonescaller&r, the summoning skeleton mage."
	quest.76D37CF58ECE345F.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Bonescaller"
	quest.778311AB6DA92C8C.quest_desc: ["&l&eDefeat the eldrich spider that is tormentor."]
	quest.778311AB6DA92C8C.quest_subtitle: "&l&cThe spider of all worlds"
	quest.778311AB6DA92C8C.title: "&l&6Kill The Tormentor"
	quest.778486A0C58DCE89.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Siamese Skeletons are similar to the Baby Skeleton, but they pose a unique threat due to their ability to split."
		"When their health drops to less than half, they will divide into two separate skeletons, effectively doubling your opponents. Your goal is to defeat them before they can split, or quickly destroy the two separate entities after they divide. Upon death, they drop Fused Bone."
	]
	quest.778486A0C58DCE89.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the Siamese Skeletons&r before they divide."
	quest.778486A0C58DCE89.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Destroying the Siamese Skeletons"
	quest.77A18A6B0A20ACC7.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Night Lich is the first boss in the mod, found in rare towers that spawn in cold biomes. You locate these towers by following the Soul Stars, which are dropped by killing Undead mobs."
		""
		"The Lich utilizes several dangerous attacks:"
		""
		"It throws a massive ball that deals significant damage."
		""
		"It uses a laser attack that causes consistent damage."
		""
		"It can summon Phantoms to overwhelm you."
		""
		"Defeating this powerful foe will reward you with a large amount of experience."
	]
	quest.77A18A6B0A20ACC7.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Night Lich&r boss found in its rare towers."
	quest.77A18A6B0A20ACC7.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&cSlaying the Night Lich"
	quest.78A394A302B8DE35.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Book of Disenchantment is a powerful magical item in the Corail Tombstone mod. This book allows you to remove enchantments from your tools, weapons, and armor."
		""
		"This is a valuable tool for refining your gear and freeing up enchantments that you want to transfer or simply remove from an item. Once crafted, you can reuse this book multiple times to perfect your equipment! 🔮"
	]
	quest.78A394A302B8DE35.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Book of Disenchantment&r to remove unwanted enchantments."
	quest.78A394A302B8DE35.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Book of Disenchantment 📖✨"
	quest.78C5FE8788B14389.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Gate Guardian is the final boss of the mod, described as a god. To kill him, you must hold a godly power, which means crafting and wielding the Thunder Sword, the only weapon that works against him."
		""
		"To prepare for this ultimate fight:"
		""
		"Summon the Boss: You must right-click the keylock in the arena with a Flesh Key to awaken him."
		""
		"Thunder Sword: This weapon strikes lightning, charging up by 7 with every hit (up to 150)."
		""
		"Releasing Power: You can release the charge by right-clicking, which grants godly regeneration and huge resistance, while unleashing constant damage to all nearby entities. The duration of this effect depends on the charge number."
		""
		"Upon defeating the Gate Guardian, he drops the Dimensional Key, which is your only way to escape Limbo and return to the Overworld! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.78C5FE8788B14389.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Gate Guardian&r, the final boss of Limbo."
	quest.78C5FE8788B14389.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lConquering the Gate Guardian"
	quest.7A4B24EFB4B72515.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Skin Crawler is the weakest enemy in the mod, but it is also the most relentless. This small creature is highly difficult to track and avoid due to its unique abilities:"
		""
		"Camouflage: It is capable of camouflaging itself by changing color to match the blocks around it."
		""
		"Mobility: It can climb walls and crawl through tight spaces, making it hard to fully avoid."
		""
		"Block Destruction: It can break through stone, deepslate, tuff, granite, diorite, andesite, and netherrack to get to you (though this ability can be disabled in config)."
		""
		"The Skin Crawler also attacks chickens. Hunt down this elusive enemy and prove that even the smallest threat cannot escape your notice!"
	]
	quest.7A4B24EFB4B72515.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay the relentless Skin Crawler&r, the weakest but most elusive enemy."
	quest.7A4B24EFB4B72515.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&2Slaying the Skin Crawle"
	quest.7A8F9D85EE2E3203.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Decrepit Skeleton is a shabby version of a normal skeleton. This enemy is a relatively weak opponent and does not possess any special properties."
		"However, this skeleton can only attack in melee, forcing you to get close to engage. Defeat this basic undead foe to begin asserting your dominance over the chaos of the night! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.7A8F9D85EE2E3203.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Slay a Decrepit Skeleton&r, the melee-only undead."
	quest.7A8F9D85EE2E3203.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Slaying the Decrepit Skeleton "
	quest.7BA4F61FBE1C4E4C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Predator Dagger is a powerful new weapon added to the mod. This specialized weapon is crafted using resources acquired from one of the more elusive and terrifying creatures found in the dimension."
		""
		"You must first hunt and defeat a Skinwalker to obtain the required Skinwalker Hide. Once you have the hide, you can use it to forge this dagger and add it to your growing arsenal of Darksteel and Carbon Blood tools! ⚔️"
	]
	quest.7BA4F61FBE1C4E4C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Predator Dagger&r using Skinwalker Hide."
	quest.7BA4F61FBE1C4E4C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Predator Dagger"
	quest.7C4C33289F499615.quest_desc: [
		"&rWith the Full Body already assembled, your next critical step is preparing the creation for life. You must craft the Clinical Stretch."
		""
		"This specialized bed is used to initiate the final stages of the resurrection process. The Clinical Stretch provides the essential foundation needed for the body's imminent revival, preparing it for the spark of life. Forge this piece of equipment to advance your Mobstein creation to its final stage!"
	]
	quest.7C4C33289F499615.quest_subtitle: "&7Prepare your first Mobstein creation for revival."
	quest.7C4C33289F499615.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eThe Awakening"
	quest.7CC54C1DC7C6F362.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Sculk Transmitter is a high-tech artifact from the Deep Dark, essential for advanced exploration and communication within the Deeper and Darker mod."
		""
		"This device allows you to send signals across long distances by utilizing the strange, resonant energy of the Sculk. You must secure the required materials, likely including components salvaged from the Ancient City, and craft or discover this Transmitter to unlock new utility in the dimension. 🛰️"
	]
	quest.7CC54C1DC7C6F362.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Acquire a Sculk Transmitter&r, the device for distant communication."
	quest.7CC54C1DC7C6F362.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&9Acquiring the Sculk Transmitter 📡🎶"
	quest.7F06EFBD644D6B57.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Bone Heart is a significant crafting item in the mod, often used as a powerful component in high-tier recipes."
		"This item is essential for unlocking advanced gear and permanent upgrades. While the exact recipe is complex, you must gather the necessary resources to forge the Bone Heart and further enhance your abilities against the chaos of the night!"
	]
	quest.7F06EFBD644D6B57.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Bone Heart&r, the powerful enhancement item."
	quest.7F06EFBD644D6B57.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Bone Heart"
	quest.7F5B01F81CAF4394.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spider Matriarch is a monstrously large side-boss, primarily found spawning in the webbed wastelands and within Spider Cave structures. This beast is designed after the Texas Wolf Spider."
		""
		"Key Mechanics and Strategy:"
		""
		"Paralysis: Its attacks can inflict a paralysis effect that stacks, increasing the duration with each hit."
		""
		"Devastating Leap: The Matriarch performs gigantic leaps toward you, gaining Strength II mid-air for devastating damage, making it a threat even to flying players. Below half health, it jumps twice as frequently."
		""
		"Minion Spawning: If you attack it while it has an egg under its abdomen, multiple Matriarch Larvae will spawn underneath it."
		""
		"Strategy: The recommended tactic is to find a tight space where its massive size prevents it from reaching you, and then use ranged weapons to attack it from a distance."
		""
		"Upon defeat, the Matriarch drops Entropy Matrix Shards, which provide an alternative way to obtain Entropy Matrixes."
	]
	quest.7F5B01F81CAF4394.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Defeat the Spider Matriarch&r side-boss in the webbed wastelands or Spider Cave."
	quest.7F5B01F81CAF4394.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&eSlaying the Spider Matriarch"
	quest.7FCDD1A9048AABF6.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Thunder Sword is the only weapon capable of killing the final boss, the Gate Guardian, as it channels godly power. To craft this legendary weapon, you must first create its core component, the Blade."
		""
		"The Thunder Sword requires several key materials, including Darksteel, Thunder Gems, and the Templar Artifact. Focus on forging the Blade using these elements. Once the Blade is complete, you will be one step closer to unleashing constant damage and gaining immense regeneration in battle! 💥"
	]
	quest.7FCDD1A9048AABF6.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Thunder Sword Blade&r, the core of the boss-slaying weapon."
	quest.7FCDD1A9048AABF6.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&lForging the Thunder Sword Blade"
